#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_payroll_expense
msgid ""
"\n"
"Reimbursement of expenses in Payslips\n"
"=====================================\n"
"\n"
"This application allows you to reimburse expenses in payslips.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ການສົ່ງເງິນຄືນລາຍຈ່າຍໃນໃບຈ່າຍເງິນເດືອນ\n"
"=====================================\n"
"\n"
"ລະບົບນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດສົ່ງເງິນຄືນລາຍຈ່າຍຜ່ານໃບຈ່າຍເງິນເດືອນໄດ້.\n"

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hr_payroll_expense.view_account_payment_register_form_inherit_hr_payroll_expense
msgid ""
"<span class=\"fw-bold\">\n"
"                            The expenses will already be reimbursed in a "
"payslip. Make sure this payment is intended.\n"
"                        </span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"fw-bold\">\n"
"                            ລາຍຈ່າຍນີ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຄືນໃນໃບຈ່າຍເງິນເດືອນແລ້ວ. "
"ກະລຸນາກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າການຊຳລະເງິນນີ້ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການແລ້ວ.\n"
"                        </span>"

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hr_payroll_expense.hr_expense_view_form_inherit_payroll
