msgstr "ສົ່ງ, ກວດສອບ ແລະ ອອກໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນຄືນສຳລັບລາຍຈ່າຍພະນັກງານ"

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"The '%(account_name)s' account for the salary rule '%(rule_name)s' must be "
"of type 'Payable'."
msgstr ""
"ບັນຊີ '%(account_name)s' ສຳລັບກົດລະບຽບເງິນເດືອນ '%(rule_name)s' ຕ້ອງເປັນປະເພດ "
"'ໜີ້ຕ້ອງສົ່ງ'."

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/product_template.py:0
msgid ""
"The salary rules linked to a product must have a debit account of type "
"'Liability Payable'.\n"
"Please fix the following salary rule(s): %s"
msgstr ""
"ກົດລະບຽບເງິນເດືອນທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບສິນຄ້າ ຕ້ອງມີບັນຊີໜີ້ (Debit) ປະເພດ 'ໜີ້ສິນຕ້ອງສົ່ງ'.\n"
"ກະລຸນາແກ້ໄຂກົດລະບຽບເງິນເດືອນດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້: %s"

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/hr_expense.py:0
msgid "There are no valid expenses selected."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີລາຍຈ່າຍທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຖືກເລືອກໄວ້."

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/product_template.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot assign multiple salary rules to the same structure for this "
"product.\n"
"Please fix the following structure(s): %s"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດກຳນົດຫຼາຍກົດລະບຽບເງິນເດືອນໃຫ້ກັບໂຄງສ້າງດຽວກັນສຳລັບສິນຄ້ານີ້ໄດ້.\n"
"ກະລຸນາແກ້ໄຂໂຄງສ້າງດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້: %s"

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/hr_expense.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot remove an expense from a payslip that has already been "
"validated.\n"
"Expenses can only be removed from draft or canceled payslips."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບລາຍຈ່າຍອອກຈາກໃບຈ່າຍເງິນເດືອນທີ່ຜ່ານການກວດສອບຢັ້ງຢືນແລ້ວໄດ້.\n"
"ລາຍຈ່າຍສາມາດລຶບອອກໄດ້ສະເພາະຈາກໃບຈ່າຍເງິນເດືອນສະບັບຮ່າງ ຫຼື ທີ່ຖືກຍົກເລີກແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/hr_expense.py:0
msgid "You do not have permission to add this expense to a payslip."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ມີສິດອະນຸຍາດໃນການເພີ່ມລາຍຈ່າຍນີ້ເຂົ້າໃນໃບຈ່າຍເງິນເດືອນ."

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/hr_payslip.py:0
msgid ""
"You don't have the access rights to link an expense to a payslip. You need "
"to be a payroll officer to do that."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງໃນການເຊື່ອມໂຍງລາຍຈ່າຍກັບໃບຈ່າຍເງິນເດືອນ. "
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປັນເຈົ້າໜ້າທີ່ຄຸ້ມຄອງເງິນເດືອນຈຶ່ງຈະສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້."

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/account_move.py:0
msgid "You don't have the access rights to post an invoice."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງໃນການລົງບັນຊີໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້."

#~ msgid "Employee (Through a Payslip)"
#~ msgstr "ພະນັກງານ (ຜ່ານໃບຈ່າຍເງິນເດືອນ)"

#~ msgid "Reimbursement"
#~ msgstr "ການສົ່ງເງິນຄືນ"
